# Git commits

Full reference: [`.agents/rules/git-commits.md`](../../.agents/rules/git-commits.md).

Only commit when the user asks.

```text
<type>(optional-scope): <imperative summary>

Optional body: why, not a file list.
```

Types: `feat` | `fix` | `refactor` | `chore` | `docs` | `test` | `style`

- Imperative, ≤72 chars, no trailing period
- One logical change; HEREDOC for the message
- No `--no-verify` / amend-pushed unless user asks

```text
feat(api): add OIDC session for GET /api/me

Subject is the IdP sub so console and API share identity.
```

```text
# ❌ BAD
Updated files and fixed stuff
```
